OL,3,GNEWSAParts of M18 closed in both
OL,4,Adirections after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are facing delays on the M18
OL,7,Fnear Doncaster following a "serious
OL,8,Fcollision" involving two cars, police
OL,9,Fand National Highways have said.
OL,11,FClosures are in place between junctions
OL,12,Fthree and five on the northbound
OL,13,Fcarriageway and junctions four and five
OL,14,Fon the southbound carriageway, near
OL,15,FThorne.
OL,17,FNational Highways said a diversion put
OL,18,Fin place as a result of the crash would
OL,19,Fremain in operation while investigation
OL,20,Fworks continued.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
